@file topics.h
@brief Project specific Doxygen topics definitions.

@details
This file serves as the main entry point for the Doxygen documentation of the µOS++ Intrusive Lists utilities.
It organizes and includes the documentation topics, file and folder references, and API groups that make up the
structure of the generated documentation. The order of the `@include` directives determines the order of sections
in the sidebar and navigation. This file ensures that users can easily explore the available modules, APIs, and
supporting information for the utilities package.
